Z||000000||Slick781||12-21-2000||10:00 PM||||Well, I've been reading this message bored regularly for quite some time now, and i figured its about time i registered me a user name and started posting.  My dad is "mbramble"... we have a 87 coupe, which we have done a few things to, like a GT nose, new dash, power everything, and a few others.  Its his car but I drive it, and im tired of not being able to do anything cool to it since its his (like as much of a system as will fit, and other cool stuff), so ive been thinkin bout gettin my own car, and figured i might as well get a fiero, cuz its cheap, and looks good.  Being a student athlete in high school, i dont have much time for a job, therefor not much money.  I did have a job in which i saved about 1000 bucks, and i figure i can make some loans from grandparents etc.  Thats all, just wanted to say hey everyone and tell ya a lil about me.<P>David Bramblett||||reg||1
